\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Structured comparison of self-evolving methods for unified understanding and generation. We group methods by supervision, tasks improved (U\,=\,understanding, G\,=\,generation), architecture dependence, and cross-paradigm generalizability. Our method is the only fully self-supervised, architecture-agnostic U+G approach validated with one unchanged recipe across diffusion, flow matching, and autoregressive paradigms.}}{4}{table.caption.3}\protected@file@percent }
